            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Osaka 88",
            "review_text": "Tour19575060669\n1 contribution\n0\nSushi buffet for your group\nApr 2026 • Friends\nMy group of five people went to a sushi buffet on the 7th evening, and it was actually pretty cute. First I got to enjoy a sashimi boat 100 pieces for 10 fish, fresh and lots. Then add some other foods continuously, do not wait long, sushi roll fevered, seafood handrolls are still brittle and not soft. I only found Nabe water a little spicy to my taste, but the stuff was fresh. Oh, the bar is on the road one way, so note to go slowly, otherwise you have to turn around too far.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten May 19, 2026",
