            "review_text": "yud d\n5 contributions\n0\nLunch is good for office people.\nApr 2026 • Friends\nToday I asked colleagues to go to OSAKA 88 PREMIUM for lunch, call a combo lunch and order some more sushi for dinner. I have to say that the fish here is really fresh, some pieces are sliced, and the rice is smooth, so you can eat it full of stomach without getting sick at all. The staff is polite, each crime is on time so the food comes out a little slow because of the crowd of guests. The little tip is that everyone should come early before 12h for cheese, and it is easy to choose a nice seat. In general, this is a pretty good choice for office lunch, I will definitely come back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten May 5, 2026",
